-KAWAD SWAD ERP
-MASTER APPS SCRIPT SECURITY & SINGLE-WRITE-OWNER REPAIR BLUEPRINT
-Mission: 51B-1R-E2E
-Prepared: 24 November 2026
-Basis:
-1. Kawad_Swad_Bound_Apps_Script_Source_READONLY.zip
-2. Mission_51B1R_E2D_Complete_Apps_Script_Audit.txt
-3. Kawad_Swad_ERP_Complete_Master_Policy_Constitution_v1.2.txt
-
-DOCUMENT STATUS: DESIGN PROPOSAL ONLY
-IMPLEMENTATION STATUS: NOT AUTHORIZED
-TEST STATUS: NOT AUTHORIZED
-PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT / MUTATION: NOT AUTHORIZED
-TX-FINAL-03: OPEN / BLOCKED
